            "question_1": "What is a wedding band?",
            "answer_1": "<p>A wedding band is a ring exchanged during the wedding ceremony to symbolize love, commitment, and a lifelong partnership. It is typically worn alongside an engagement ring.</p>",
            "question_2": "What is the difference between a wedding band and an engagement ring?",
            "answer_2": "<p>An engagement ring is given during the proposal and usually features a center diamond, while a wedding band is exchanged during the wedding ceremony and often has a simpler design.</p>",
            "question_3": "Can you wear a wedding band without an engagement ring?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes. Many people choose to wear only a wedding band for its simplicity, comfort, and timeless style.</p>",
