            "answer_7": "<p>Classic plain bands, diamond eternity bands, half-eternity bands, and minimalist gold bands are among the most popular wedding band styles.</p>",
            "question_8": "What is the difference between a full eternity band and a half eternity band?",
            "answer_8": "<p>A full eternity band features diamonds around the entire ring, while a half eternity band has diamonds only across the top, making it easier to resize and often more comfortable for daily wear.</p>",
            "question_9": "Can wedding bands be resized?",
            "answer_9": "<p>Most plain metal and half eternity wedding bands can be resized. Full eternity bands are generally more difficult or sometimes impossible to resize because diamonds encircle the entire band.</p>",
